This repository holds coursework produced for a seminar at the Technical University of
Munich in Winter Semester 2025/26. It is published so the work can be read, not so it can
be reused: no licence to copy, modify, distribute or create derivative works is granted.

No open-source licence is offered here, and that is deliberate rather than an oversight.
The work has three authors, listed under Contributors in README.md, so no one of them can
grant those rights alone. Anyone wanting to reuse any part of it should ask all three.

Two things in this repository are not the authors' to license at all, and are covered by
their own terms rather than this notice:

  - The HBV model formulation and any course-provided material, which belong to the
    Chair of Hydrology and River Basin Management.
  - Third-party libraries listed in requirements.txt, each under its own licence.

Reading, citing and quoting with attribution are all fine. Reuse of the code or the
figures is not, without permission.
